	(text "USB HUB — TUSB8041 (4-port SS hub), 24 MHz crystal, 1.1 V core LDO, pin straps, GRSTz, USB_VBUS divider\nGolden reference: datasheets/reference/ti-sllu198-tusb8041-evm-users-guide.pdf (copy the EVM schematic), datasheets/tusb8041.pdf\nParts (LCSC): TUSB8041IRGCR C544686 (D4: alternatives RTS5411S C5356838, CYUSB3304 C462531)\nUpstream: US_SSTX/SSRX + US_DP/DM from usbc-upstream. USB_VBUS sense from the VBUS net via the 90.9 kΩ divider (detection only).\nDS1–DS3 → usb-port-1..3 (SS + HS, PWRCTLx → switch EN, OVERCURxz ← switch fault). DS4 → servo-uart, USB 2.0 only (V5: unused SS pin termination).\nConsumes: +3V3, GND.  Produces: +1V1_HUB (LDO per datasheet).\nOpen items: D4 (hub choice), D5 (pin-strap vs EEPROM, suspend port-power behaviour), V5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 12.7 0)
